// Typechecks the test files, which `tsconfig.json` excludes from the build
// (tests must not emit into dist/).
//
// Without this, tests are transpile-only under vitest: a fixture can keep
// building a shape the types no longer describe and stay green until the line
// happens to run. That is not hypothetical — after `Attachment.data` became
// `handle`, nine test files here kept writing `{ data }` and the suite passed,
// because this package typechecked no tests at all.
//
// SCOPE: the whole suite, and it must stay that way. Unlike the SDK's ratchet
// there is no inherited debt to work through — the 51 errors this first turned
// up were all fixed when it was introduced. A new exclusion here is a hole of
// exactly the kind described above, so widen the fixes, not the exclude list.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noEmit": true
  },
  "include": ["src/**/*.ts", "src/**/*.tsx"],
  "exclude": ["node_modules", "dist"]
}
